<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back">返回</view><view class="top-title"><view class="top-title-main">删除社群内容</view><view class="top-title-sub">仅管理你发布的经历、评论和公开路线</view></view></view><view class="safe-tip">删除后无法恢复；关联图片和你主动公开的路线会一并移除。</view><view class="section-title">我发布的经历</view><view wx:if="{{posts.length}}" class="stack gap-12"><view wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" class="social-card"><view class="avatar">{{initial}}</view><view class="grow copy"><view class="content-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="tiny">{{nickname}} · {{item.time}}</view><view class="route-state">{{item.route}}</view></view><view class="delete-link {{deletingId === 'post:' + item.id ? 'delete-link-disabled' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="deletePost">{{deletingId === 'post:' + item.id ? '删除中' : '删除'}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-card">你还没有发布可删除的经历</view><view class="section-title">我的评论</view><view wx:if="{{comments.length}}" class="stack gap-12"><view wx:for="{{comments}}" wx:key="index" class="social-card"><view class="avatar">{{initial}}</view><view class="grow copy"><view class="content-title">{{item.text}}</view><view class="tiny">评论于《{{item.postTitle}}》 · {{item.time}}</view></view><view class="delete-link {{deletingId === 'comment:' + item.postId + ':' + item.index ? 'delete-link-disabled' : ''}}" data-postid="{{item.postId}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="deleteComment">{{deletingId === 'comment:' + item.postId + ':' + item.index ? '删除中' : '删除'}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-card">你还没有发布可删除的评论</view></view>
